{c: Verse 1}
[F] [D#],        Kasme waade pyaar wafaa sab,
[D#] [F],        Baatein hain baato ka kya
[F] [A#],        Koyi kisi ka nahi ye jhoothhe,
[A#] [F],        Naate hain naato ka kya
[F] [A#] [F],        Hoga masiha...
